  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline WASABI PRO HYBRID combines WASABI Neon Pink 1.23 in the mains with WASABI X Neon Blue 1.23 in the crosses. The square-shaped WASABI mains provide maximum mechanical ball grip, while the slick round WASABI X crosses reduce inter-string friction and allow the mains to move and snap back rapidly. This interaction creates a dedicated high-spin hybrid with strong bite, high string movement and massive rotational output.",

    "zh": "Toroline WASABI PRO HYBRID 采用 WASABI Neon Pink 1.23 作为主线，并搭配 WASABI X Neon Blue 1.23 作为横线。四边形 WASABI 主线通过锐利边缘提供最大机械咬球，而圆形超光滑 WASABI X 横线则降低主横线之间的摩擦，让主线在击球时更容易滑动，并在之后快速 Snapback。两者结合形成一套非常典型的高旋转 Hybrid，同时利用 Mechanical Ball Grip 与低摩擦 Snapback 来制造大量旋转。"
  },

